  "filter_caveat": "The DW-NDW contrast requires >=3 members in BOTH groups, which is asymmetric by construction: only an arm with a strong forced shift can push nearly every member into one class. 11 of 36 nudged ensembles are dropped that way, with a mean DW rate of 0.993, while 0 of 36 control ensembles are. Quote mean_DW_rate_UNCONDITIONAL for the rate; the contrast is necessarily conditioned on the ensembles where both groups exist, which are the weaker-responding ones.",
